        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "f69",
          "name": "左栏 · 其说",
          "width": 808,
          "height": "fit_content",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 32,
          "alignItems": "start",
          "fill": [],
          "x": 120,
          "y": 264,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "t66",
              "name": "栏题",
              "content": "其说",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 40,
              "fontWeight": 600,
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "$c-ink-soft"
                }
              ],
              "lineHeight": 1.35,
              "letterSpacing": 0,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "t67",
              "name": "左栏正文",
              "content": "通行的做法是给每一栏加一个\n圆角卡片，再用底色把两边分开。\n分是分开了，读者读到的却是\n两张卡片，而不是一篇文章的\n两个部分。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 32,
              "fontWeight": 400,
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "$c-ink"
                }
              ],
              "lineHeight": 1.75,
              "letterSpacing": 0,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "t68",
              "name": "左栏续",
              "content": "卡片还有一个副作用：它必须有内边距，\n于是同一块版心里，能排的字更少，\n行却没有因此变短。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 32,
              "fontWeight": 400,
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "$c-ink-soft"
                }
              ],
              "lineHeight": 1.75,
              "letterSpacing": 0,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "f75",
          "name": "右栏 · 我见",
          "width": 808,
          "height": "fit_content",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 32,
          "alignItems": "start",
          "fill": [],
          "x": 992,
          "y": 264,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
