              "padding": [
                24,
                24
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "t70",
                  "name": "首句",
                  "content": "界行只标记分栏，不圈占内容。",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 32,
                  "fontWeight": 500,
                  "fill": [
                    {
                      "type": "solid",
                      "color": "$c-ink"
                    }
                  ],
                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                  "letterSpacing": 0,
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "t73",
              "name": "右栏正文",
              "content": "线画在版面上，卡片扣在内容上。\n界行贯穿整个版心，不随文字长短\n伸缩；它分的是版面，不是归属。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 32,
              "fontWeight": 400,
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "$c-ink"
                }
              ],
              "lineHeight": 1.75,
              "letterSpacing": 0,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "t74",
              "name": "右栏续",
              "content": "把分栏交给线之后，栏宽就能完全由\n行长决定：三十字一行，多出来的宽度\n留给留白，而不是留给边框。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 32,
              "fontWeight": 400,
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "$c-ink-soft"
                }
              ],
              "lineHeight": 1.75,
              "letterSpacing": 0,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container"
            }
          ]
        },
